<title>HUNGARY: Egis Jan-Sept 1996 net profit 4.082 bln.</title>
<headline>Egis Jan-Sept 1996 net profit 4.082 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine-month period ending Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					Jan-Sept 96     Jan-Sept 95</p>
<p>    Operating profit		3,550     vs    3,067</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		  4,082     vs    3,825</p>
<p>    After-tax profit		4,082     vs    3,825</p>
<p>    Net sales			17,354     vs   14,444</p>
<p>	Net domestic sales	  9,475     vs    7,931</p>
<p>	Net export sales	    7,878     vs    6,514</p>
<p>    Other revenue		     467     vs	457</p>
<p>    Direct costs of sales	 5,341     vs    4,431</p>
<p>    Indirect costs of sales     8,052     vs    6,579</p>
<p>    Net financial income	    413     vs	375</p>
<p>	Financial revenue	     470     vs	603</p>
<p>	Financial expenditures	 57     vs	228</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income	119     vs	383</p>
<p>	Extraordinary revenue	 231     vs	441</p>
<p>	Extraordinary expenditure   112     vs	 58</p>
<p>NOTE - Egis Gyogyszergyar Rt is a pharmaceuticals company, majority owned by France's Servier S.A.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
